		<h4>チョコエッグ　日本の動物コレクション第5弾</h4>
		<table style="width: 100%">
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2">
				<a href="img/anima_jap5_006.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/anima_jap5_006_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- Documents/My Web Sites/mysite2/anima/anima_jap5/img/anima_jap5_006.jpg" --></a></td>
